            "target_entity_instance": "Pearson correlation coefficient",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "The study focused on peak discharge estimation as it is the primary parameter for flood hazard mapping and infrastructure design in the region (USACE 1998). The correlation analysis examined rainfall-peak flow relationships to verify model consistency. To assess the relationship between design rainfall and predicted flood discharges, Pearson correlation coefficients were calculated using present period values from Tables 7 and 8 across ten basins.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
